han relying on a similarity score\n  over evidence prose\n- OR record the closed question id on the decision's evidence entry and have the\n  already-answered pass treat an exact closed-question-text match as answered\n  regardless of the noul score\n\nACCEPTANCE CRITERIA\n- the documented loop (ask -> answer -> ask) never re-proposes the question text\n  that the previous answer closed, on a fresh namespace, reproduced as a test\n- a duplicate decision is NOT created to close a re-proposed twin\n- the second ask still works normally when the closed question was a DIFFERENT\n  text (the gate must not simply suppress the next question)\n- ruff check auger.py clean", "capability_tags": ["+engine", "+method"], "attempts": 0, "blocks": [], "depends_on": [], "detail": {}, "files_changed": [], "foreman_note": "Recovered close, tick auger-2026-09-24-closeout (continuation of auger-2026-09-23-21-13-24): worker gpt-5.6-luna@openai-codex commit 4f017c3 (+76/-4, auger.py + tests/test_auger.py) landed and pushed; origin/main parity 0; CI run on 4f017c3 SUCCESS (gh run list, conclusion=success, createdAt 2026-09-24T08:07:13Z). gitreins lifecycle recovered: prior session created+completed task AUG-056 but died (gateway drain_timeout) before any verdict; no async job existed (jobs scan, task_id AUG-056: none); recovered per off-by-one answer 1925 (the gitreins task complete killed by CLI timeout class (async judge is the remedy)): gitreins judge --async AUG-056 dispatched this tick as job-783e41e429e343639249d96d4eacd00e (poll: gitreins judge --status job-783e41e429e343639249d96d4eacd00e). Tier-1 evidence of record: worker pre-commit gitreins guard Tier-1 PASS + foreman bash tests/gate.sh GATE PASS this tick (/tmp/auger-2026-09-24-closeout_gate.log: pytest 141 passed incl. both new closed-question regressions, smoke 21/21, ruff clean). VERDICT PENDING: async job in flight at close time; next tick folds the landed verdict from .gitreins/history/2026-09-24/ as its first commit.", "g